@startuml

actor "You\n(Cardholder)" as User
participant "Online Shop\n(Merchant)" as Shop

box "Payment Provider / PSP\n(e.g. Stripe, Adyen)"
    participant "Payment System\n+ 3DS Server" as PSP
end box

participant "Visa / Mastercard" as Network
participant "Your Bank\n(Issuer + ACS)" as Bank

User -> Shop: 1. Click Pay
Shop -> PSP: 2. Create payment

== 3DS Authentication ==

PSP -> Network: 3. Authenticate cardholder
Network -> Bank: 4. Authentication request

alt Bank wants challenge
    Bank -> User: 5. Approve in app / OTP
    User -> Bank: Approved
end

Bank --> Network: Authentication OK
Network --> PSP: Authentication OK

== Payment Authorization ==

PSP -> Network: 6. Charge €100
Network -> Bank: 7. Authorize €100

Bank -> Bank: Check balance,\ncard limits, fraud, etc.

Bank --> Network: 8. APPROVED
Network --> PSP: APPROVED
PSP --> Shop: 9. Payment successful
Shop --> User: Order confirmed

@enduml